    (hP:AtLeast w n P) (hQ:AtLeast w n Q):AtLeast w n (P-Q):=by
  change P ∈ MvPolynomial.restrictSupport K {d | n≤Finsupp.weight w d} at hP
  change Q ∈ MvPolynomial.restrictSupport K {d | n≤Finsupp.weight w d} at hQ
