    _=(b-x)*((L+1-i-j)*(a-(w*i+(w-1)*j)))+(x-a)*((L+1-i-j)*(b-(w*i+(w-1)*j))):=by ring

theorem GOT (w L s T R K beta Dhi Ehi H t:ℕ) (ht:t≤H)
    (hHi:AW Ehi w (L-T) (s-R)+K<AW Dhi w L s)
    (hLo:AW (Ehi+(beta+1)*H) w (L-T) (s-R)+K<
